- **Databases**: MongoDB Atlas (domain data) + Supabase Postgres (identity/session data), per
  ADR-0002's polyglot split. Both have real, applied schemas.
- **Feature 008 (self-device GPS tracking) — built, then kill-switched, not "nothing
  implemented."** Self-device location reporting (`backend/src/routes/assets.ts`'s
  location-report endpoint, `mobile/src/location/useLocationReporter.ts`) shipped past an
  explicit ADR-0009 §14 prohibition and a Stage 8 gate — see **INC-001**
